								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16131#msg16131">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #38 on:</b> April 01, 2005, 04:27:02 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16105#msg16105">Quote from: Spaerhawk on April 01, 2005, 10:37:40 am</a></div><div class="quote">(And does it ever annoy you that they named a buff after your guild? Or are you guys all like &quot;Woot.&quot;?)<br /></div><br />A group of Conviction members competed in a GM sponsored scavenger hunt spring of 2004.  They were misinformed by a GM that titles would be given to the winners of the event.  Of course the Conviction members won the event, but were given trinkets as a prize and no title.  After much discussion to resolve the issue, it was agreed rather then award a group of 6 players titles...they would name a cleric spell after the guild.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
