							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hi Hi,<br /><br />Cold Fury member and officer here (/wave Fartek).<br />Obligatory link:<a href="http://www.coldfuryguild.com/" target="_blank">http://www.coldfuryguild.com/</a><br /><br />I am curious about this - Who rescued Firiona Vie from TOFs on the Rodcet Nife server? Here on Quellious, Cold Fury are ones with the title <b>CHOSEN GUARDIANS</b>. Since its a unique server event, only the raiders that rescued FV that particular day recieved that title. <br /><br />Once the server merges, I expect there will be Cold Fury Chosen Guardians and Rodcet Nife ones. Which is a pity really... Being unique Cold Fury Chosen Guardians was a neat thing to be. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/approve.gif" alt="approve" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />PS:<br />Whats ironic...<br />When DON was finally released, Cold Fury as a guild decided to faction for EVIL! (insert evil backstabbing jokes here). So, Firiona Vie&#039;s Chosen Guardians on Quellious is actually opposing her now!&nbsp; <br /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br /><br />---------------------------<br />Greif Level 70 Coercer<br />Chosen Guardian of Firiona Vie.<br />Backstabbing soldier of Lanys Tvyl
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: April 02, 2005, 06:13:51 am by Greif</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><b>Cold Fury - Quellious(Rodcet Nife)</b><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=217293" target="_blank">Greif the Enchanter</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
