								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16163#msg16163">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #43 on:</b> April 02, 2005, 07:49:45 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yep, mostly IL.&nbsp; Some Reign of Swords people were there too.&nbsp; Occasionaly you&#039;ll see somebody else running around with the title who didn&#039;t earn it since FV stayed up for a couple of days after the event.
