		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=486" title="View the profile of Bobo">Bobo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 72<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/weasel.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Slay masta~!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=486"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16167#msg16167"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16167#msg16167">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #44 on:</b> April 02, 2005, 10:55:48 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Yep, mostly IL.  Some Reign of Swords people were there too.  Occasionaly you&#039;ll see somebody else running around with the title who didn&#039;t earn it since FV stayed up for a couple of days after the event. <br /><br />Inner Loop had about 90% of the raid force that did the TOFS event on RN. </div> <br /><br />Satruday DA/eie cleared the most of ToFS event, up to 6th floor if I remember. Ist floor mob was the hardest, we started at like 10 AM with low numbers and finaly got enough on later in the day but at bout  2 am and folks got tired.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm33.gif" alt="cwm33" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
